{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=1476970&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-10-13T22:49:44Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"1476970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IdleOn - The Incremental MMO", "steam_appid": 1476970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>5 Years of IdleOn Content Updates!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/9b1b3a7cce4152a0efc12e06423c4271.avif?t=1783034427\" width=800 height=2200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/43056bdbbeb5bb89c663491bfb48d2db.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/43056bdbbeb5bb89c663491bfb48d2db.webm?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/43056bdbbeb5bb89c663491bfb48d2db.mp4?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The power fantasy of an MMO, with the automation of an incremental game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make progress actively by buying upgrades, optimizing skill-tree builds, min-maxing your stats, and defeating bosses! Load up IdleOn the next day, spend your AFK gains earned while you were away, and buy MORE upgrades!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/8d30f6467ba986fed33fd9c5b8ce0a98.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/8d30f6467ba986fed33fd9c5b8ce0a98.webm?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/8d30f6467ba986fed33fd9c5b8ce0a98.mp4?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Create 11 unique Classes, from Divine Knight to Bubonic Conjuror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IdleOn lets you create 11 characters, so you'll have one of each class - <strong>each one plays a unique role in your account!</strong> Just don't forget about the secret class-line, including a secret Subclass, secret Elite-class, and secret Mastercl... I've already said too much...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/c40dc38e20e9520a1e08f2aa93d46328.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/c40dc38e20e9520a1e08f2aa93d46328.webm?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/c40dc38e20e9520a1e08f2aa93d46328.mp4?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique gameplay with non-fighting mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll do more than just fight - in your quest toward the endgame, you'll need to attain full mastery over skills like Cooking, Woodcutting, Alchemy, Construction, and MUCH more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/811aae38bde629112e26e81bd78a5981.avif?t=1783034427\" width=598 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the biggest incremental community in gaming - 200,000+ members</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer posts, giveaways, and game discussions await you in IdleOn's Discord server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/0a4e28360217d3263f9771f7923392ad.gif?t=1783034427\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/0a4e28360217d3263f9771f7923392ad.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free-to-Play note:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IdleOn is free to play, and all classes, maps, skills, bosses, and activities are available without purchase. There is no paid DLC or exclusive gameplay content locked behind a paywall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional in-game purchases are available, including helpful boosts and collectible pets, but they are not required to explore the world, unlock classes, or play through IdleOn’s core systems.<br><br><i>IdleOn is a long-term idler game, made for those seeking out a multi-year long experience!</i><br><br><i>Looking for a short, premium idler game instead? My new game Fortune Mill is what you want :D</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/43056bdbbeb5bb89c663491bfb48d2db.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/43056bdbbeb5bb89c663491bfb48d2db.webm?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/43056bdbbeb5bb89c663491bfb48d2db.mp4?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The power fantasy of an MMO, with the automation of an incremental game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make progress actively by buying upgrades, optimizing skill-tree builds, min-maxing your stats, and defeating bosses! Load up IdleOn the next day, spend your AFK gains earned while you were away, and buy MORE upgrades!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/8d30f6467ba986fed33fd9c5b8ce0a98.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/8d30f6467ba986fed33fd9c5b8ce0a98.webm?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/8d30f6467ba986fed33fd9c5b8ce0a98.mp4?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Create 11 unique Classes, from Divine Knight to Bubonic Conjuror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IdleOn lets you create 11 characters, so you'll have one of each class - <strong>each one plays a unique role in your account!</strong> Just don't forget about the secret class-line, including a secret Subclass, secret Elite-class, and secret Mastercl... I've already said too much...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/c40dc38e20e9520a1e08f2aa93d46328.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/c40dc38e20e9520a1e08f2aa93d46328.webm?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/c40dc38e20e9520a1e08f2aa93d46328.mp4?t=1783034427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique gameplay with non-fighting mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll do more than just fight - in your quest toward the endgame, you'll need to attain full mastery over skills like Cooking, Woodcutting, Alchemy, Construction, and MUCH more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/811aae38bde629112e26e81bd78a5981.avif?t=1783034427\" width=598 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the biggest incremental community in gaming - 200,000+ members</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developer posts, giveaways, and game discussions await you in IdleOn's Discord server!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/0a4e28360217d3263f9771f7923392ad.gif?t=1783034427\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/extras/0a4e28360217d3263f9771f7923392ad.poster.avif?t=1783034427\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free-to-Play note:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IdleOn is free to play, and all classes, maps, skills, bosses, and activities are available without purchase. There is no paid DLC or exclusive gameplay content locked behind a paywall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional in-game purchases are available, including helpful boosts and collectible pets, but they are not required to explore the world, unlock classes, or play through IdleOn’s core systems.<br><br><i>IdleOn is a long-term idler game, made for those seeking out a multi-year long experience!</i><br><br><i>Looking for a short, premium idler game instead? My new game Fortune Mill is what you want :D</i></p>", "short_description": "The incremental idle MMO where your heroes keep fighting while you're gone! Spend their loot on upgrades, unlock classes from Elemental-Wizard to Cannon-Pirate, and level 20 unique skills like Farming, Sailing, and Construction!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/header.jpg?t=1783034427", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/6c5ebda02c5a3ee53ed0ce584e9b4db2a8f3909a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783034427", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476970/6c5ebda02c5a3ee53ed0ce584e9b4db2a8f3909a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783034427", "website": "https://www.legendsofidleon.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> An Intel Pentium 4 processor or later that's SSE3 capable<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hardware Accelerated Graphics with dedicated memory<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Anything capable of producing sound.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "ext_user_account_notice": "IdleOn Account ", "developers": ["Lavaflame2"], "publishers": ["Lavaflame2"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 20, "description": "MMO"}, {"i